{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411260","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411260","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1341126001:1":{"text":"请允许我再次多谢各位的馈赠。那株冰蓝灵蔓根对我的画来说意义重大。","source_cn":"请允许我再次多谢各位的馈赠。那株冰蓝灵蔓根对我的画来说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3EDE3C46ECC51D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1341126001":{"text":"请允许我再次多谢各位的馈赠。那株冰蓝灵蔓根对我的画来说意义重大。","source_cn":"请允许我再次多谢各位的馈赠。那株冰蓝灵蔓根对我的画来说意义重大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3EDE3C46ECC51D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341126002:1":{"text":"这不是客气，是真心的感谢。这幅画很重要。","source_cn":"这不是客气，是真心的感谢。这幅画很重要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE54CC7CA07C8018","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341126003:1":{"text":"我生前画过许多幅画，但我所说的这幅画，是我生前所有画作中唯一自己保存下来的。","source_cn":"我生前画过许多幅画，但我所说的这幅画，是我生前所有画作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF18BBA7D1A19B862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341126004:1":{"text":"唯一留下来的？那其他的画都去哪里了？","source_cn":"唯一留下来的？那其他的画都去哪里了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13C7BBF048A49745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1341126005:1":{"text":"我死之后，有少部分画作被别的贵族买回去收藏，毕竟我过去也算是个艺术家。但大多数都没有经得起岁月的冲刷，已经腐朽成泥了。","source_cn":"我死之后，有少部分画作被别的贵族买回去收藏，毕竟我过去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F4538DE64F579C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1341126006:1":{"text":"这幅画能够保留下来，是因为你用魔法了吗？","source_cn":"这幅画能够保留下来，是因为你用魔法了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25CEFE6619D40E7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1341126007:1":{"text":"不，我没有用魔法附灵，而是每隔十年进行一次修复，填上褪去的颜色，更换新的画框。","source_cn":"不，我没有用魔法附灵，而是每隔十年进行一次修复，填上褪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52A6AA5A014AC06F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1341126008:1":{"text":"而那幅画里最漂亮的蓝色，需要用青金石粉末和冰蓝灵蔓根粉末重叠上色才能画出。","source_cn":"而那幅画里最漂亮的蓝色，需要用青金石粉末和冰蓝灵蔓根粉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA67AD11444FB3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1341126009:1":{"text":"这些年来，冰蓝灵蔓根越来越难找了，即便是我也得花费很大的心力。所以你瞧，我并没有夸大其词，你们的礼物真的很重要。","source_cn":"这些年来，冰蓝灵蔓根越来越难找了，即便是我也得花费很大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D45E1DEBD71EEB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1341126009":{"text":"这些年来，冰蓝灵蔓根越来越难找了，即便是我也得花费很大的心力。所以你瞧，我并没有夸大其词，你们的礼物真的很重要。","source_cn":"这些年来，冰蓝灵蔓根越来越难找了，即便是我也得花费很大的心力。所以你瞧，我并没有夸大其词，你们的礼物真的很重要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D45E1DEBD71EEB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1341126010:1":{"text":"有些人喜欢留着第一份作品，因为它代表着开始；有些人则喜欢保留最好的，因为它代表了辉煌。而我选择的是“终结”——我生前最后一幅画，我的遗像。","source_cn":"有些人喜欢留着第一份作品，因为它代表着开始；有些人则喜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A685F104F437FE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1341126011:1":{"text":"我的父母曾对着它日夜哭泣哀悼，所以后来我悄悄拿走了它。","source_cn":"我的父母曾对着它日夜哭泣哀悼，所以后来我悄悄拿走了它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7FC647311F82573","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1341126012:1":{"text":"那之后，他们终于意识到死亡就是终结，是生命的必经之路。渐渐的，他们也不再因为我的离去而过分哀伤。","source_cn":"那之后，他们终于意识到死亡就是终结，是生命的必经之路。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD654628BAEB552","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1341126013:1":{"text":"所以……我会一直留着它，直到我自己彻底地、真正地死亡那天。","source_cn":"所以……我会一直留着它，直到我自己彻底地、真正地死亡那天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x913D145EBE0C0542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index"